@startuml
title Phase 1 SVG editor - dependency direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
package "src/cli" as cli
package "src/application" as app
package "src/domain" as domain
package "src/infrastructure" as infra
component "src/main.ts\nComposition root" as main
main --> cli
main --> infra
cli --> app
app --> domain
infra --> app : implements ports
infra --> domain
note bottom of domain
Shape <- Rect/Circle/Ellipse/Line/Text/Group
Group owns child Shapes (Composite).
No filesystem, XML parser or terminal dependencies.
end note
@enduml
